      "role": "user",
      "text": "Let’s see if we can make a plan to take the universal indicatrix and the other new tools I just added, and go through SAT to test it’s consistency and coherence, and to make some new predictions or rule out old ones",
      "citations": [],
      "key": "51b37ef8"
